From 0f576f158d788ae21cd239eaf013a1a883b1228b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hanoip <hanoip@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:20:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 192/194] media: qcom: camss: sm7150: add C-PHY receive and
 bring-up diagnostics

The hanoip rear main sensor (S5KHM2) is wired as C-PHY, three trios.
Accept V4L2_MBUS_CSI2_CPHY endpoints, program the SM7150 CSIPHY v1.2
trio settings from the vendor csiphy_3ph_v1_2_reg table (COMMON_CTRL5
bit 2n+1 per trio) and set PHY_TYPE_SEL in the gen2 CSID. The vendor
data-rate delta table only differs above 5.7 Gbps per trio and is not
needed for the 30 fps modes.

Bring-up module parameters, all no-ops unless written: cphy_settle_cnt
and dphy_settle override the computed settle count, lane_map rewrites
the data lane positions of one CSIPHY, and phy_status dumps the common
status registers of CSIPHYs whose lanes are enabled.
